{%- capture subject -%}Your {{ product.name }} sign-in code: {{ code }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture html -%}
<p>Hi{% if name %} {{ name }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>Enter this code to sign in to {{ product.name }}:</p>
<p style="margin:28px 0;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;">{{ code }}</p>
<p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">The code expires in 10 minutes and works only once. If you did not try to sign in, you can ignore this email; nobody can sign in without the code.</p>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture text -%}
Hi{% if name %} {{ name }}{% endif %},

Enter this code to sign in to {{ product.name }}:

{{ code }}

The code expires in 10 minutes and works only once. If you did not try to sign in, you can ignore this email; nobody can sign in without the code.
{%- endcapture -%}
